  "body": "### Summary\n\n`MessageTitleToneTests/drawnColour(dark:)` failed in the app CI on #589 at 65493071 (attempt 1, https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/actions/runs/42681255988/job/129376347176). The test took 63 s and passed on the rerun. #589 does not touch the code it covers, and the test passes locally (23/23 cases, iPad Pro 13, iOS 27.0).\n\n### Scope\n- Find what the test waits on: it renders a colour swatch and samples it.\n- Make it deterministic under CI load, without a longer timeout as the only fix.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Cause named.\n- [ ] The test passes 20 runs in a row with CPU contention on a simulator (e.g. a parallel build), and in CI.\n\nReported by mac/m2-lead.",
