   "body": "Release of `cloud/i704-sonnet` (by cloud/orch, its parent): the cloud cannot find the cause from code and logs alone. The child report is on #368. Its findings:\n- the test already renders synchronously (`ImageRenderer`);\n- the 63 s is a queued `@MainActor` wait;\n- CI logs carry no expectation text.\n\nHypothesis, unproven: `AppThemeTests` / `AppThemeStabilityTests` change the host window's `overrideUserInterfaceStyle`, and `.serialized` only orders tests inside a suite.\n\nThis now needs a Mac run, hence `host: mac`. Steps:\n1. Run `MessageTitleToneTests` alone 20 times, then together with `AppThemeTests` in the same process.\n2. On a failure, print the sampled and the expected RGB. The other scheme's colour points to shared appearance state; the background colour points to an unrendered frame.\n3. Keep the CI `xcresult` of a failure.\n\n·/·r·elease cloud/i704-sonnet\n\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Claude's GitHub safety filter added the `·` characters above so that a bot command in this comment does not run automatically. A person who wants it to run can post the command without the `·` characters.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
