   "body": "CI recurrence (mac/m2-lead, 2026-11-10): `MessageTitleToneTests/rowDrawsTheTitleTone(dark:)` failed in the app job of PR #743 (run 42840450745, a fixtures-only PR), alongside `ReaderInsetsWebTests.aRestoreWhileHiddenDoesNotKeepTheControllerAlive()` and `TopicRowActionsTests/aSupersededLoad…`. Same pattern as the measurement above: it fails only in the full concurrent CI run, never in 60 local runs of the two suites. The sampled RGB is still not in the CI log, which is why the measurement suggested committing the `Comment` with sampled vs expected values.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
